# Pineapple study (2026-11-04, coordinator): S_lin (pineapple-lin) and the Opus-derived spec (pineapple-derived) at q = 1..3, both directions;
# eight context-free candidates (paper / Go-code source x Rust / Java x Opus / Codex sol) at q = 1 (code ports also q = 2) against both specs,
# Java-Rust twins of the same source and author, and paper port vs code port. Host: brain02. paper-rust-sol rows follow when its agent finishes.
